Z||000016||Dan86gt3.8||03-24-2000||03:57 PM||||So zumalt and his kits are gone??????  I see his name mentiond in kit car a lot.  I just always liked his way of doing it better.  SO if you go with an lt1 or ls1 you can keep the pullys inside the engine bay?  That sounds good.  Ohhh ya what about getrag reliability???  They are only supposed to handle like 200-250 lbs of torque (safely).  I have heard of them being mated to the cadalic v8 tranny, the regular V8, not the north*.  Anywyas did archie ever finish that ls1 project car he was working on.  I used to emaail him aloot but his replys were few and far betwwen and pretty vauge so I gave up.  I wish he posted here, or wait does he?  or does he only post on his own board?||||reg||1
